or runtime.\r\n\r\nA proper fix is likely adding a way to update part of texture.","created_at":"2025-04-10T16:33:32Z","updated_at":"2025-04-10T16:33:32Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105008#discussion_r2037824168","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105008","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2037824168"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105008#discussion_r2037824168"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105008"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2037824168/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":848,"original_line":848,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2037806064,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":6,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2037972178","pull_request_review_id":2757769084,"id":2037972178,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc55ePzS","diff_hunk":"@@ -845,14 +845,10 @@ _FORCE_INLINE_ TextServerAdvanced::FontTexturePosition TextServerAdvanced::find_\n \n \tif (ret.index == -1) {\n \t\t// Could not find texture to fit, create one.\n-\t\tint texsize = MAX(p_data->size.x * p_data->oversampling * 8, 256);\n-\n+\t\tint texsize = MAX(p_data->size.x * p_data->oversampling * 16, 1 << min_atlas_texture_size);","path":"modules/text_server_adv/text_server_adv.cpp","commit_id":"326f28882a91f02e491549ed1e362f6c8474a0a0","original_commit_id":"326f28882a91f02e491549ed1e362f6c8474a0a0","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"> How would it help? I do not think few extra draw calls make a difference (there won't be enough text on screen to be an issue), updating bigger atlases definitely.\r\n\r\nTake a look at the issue, the current problem reduces FPS from 120 to 80. That is a significant performance issue https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104537\r\n\r\n> Instead of adding, I guess it might be better to allow using a big atlas for pre-rendering (and setting it read-only after import) and keeping default for runtime.\r\n\r\nHow often are the atlases updated at run time? \r\n\r\n> A proper fix is likely adding a way to update part of texture.\r\n\r\nIf the only problem is not supporting partial texture updates, then let's just add support for partial texture updates","created_at":"2025-04-10T17:57:11Z","updated_at":"2025-04-10T17:57:11Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105008#discussion_r2037972178","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105008","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2037972178"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105008#discussion_r2037972178"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105008"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.gi